  "reasoning": "The defendant knowingly concealed and transferred the company's accounting vouchers and books while the case was under investigation. This conduct constitutes the crime of hiding, transferring, or destroying accounting documents, as defined in Article 280 of the Criminal Law, rather than a violent obstruction of officials. Therefore the appropriate charge is the offense of concealing/transfering accounting documents.",
